    "detailed_description": "Dropped into a dark and endless alley filled with random obstacles and special items, Jim must use his only tool, a parasol that reduces his speed, to reach deeper and deeper - and, of course, to achieve a big score! DROPSOL is a small but fun retro-style casual arcade game that will challenge you to get the biggest score you can!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&gt; Main features:<br />\r\n- Retro-style graphics;<br />\r\n- Parasol that reduces your speed (but with limit durability!);<br />\r\n- Powerups - more parasol durability or invincibility (breaks the steel beams);<br />\r\n- Items that increases your speed and take points from your score;<br />\r\n- Arcade/Score Attack;<br />\r\n- Hi-Score automatic saving;<br />\r\n- Score leaderboard.",
